Date: Mon, 20 Oct 2025 22:00:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Remove useFramebufferCache parameter in 
 drawLayers()" and fix new code

Update for 16 QPR2

This reverts commit f29700fb05dd225dc5b80dac5e4d80e074622e09.

Change-Id: I74d2a7a70a609bfacbe6a0f3b1e995a96f0051c1

Adapt Android 17 draw calls, including benchmark warmup and panopticon registration.
